{"meta":{"id":"duoplay:10048","type":"series","name":"Lenna ja Lauri Ilmaveerel","poster":"https://f12.pmo.ee/T9apaHtQDhzS_0NEK0K9OA3TFEo=/510x774/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649233-4fd0b8ef-10ba-4f2f-b312-12ec14aee2b5.jpeg","background":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg","description":"Setomaa sügistalvine kaamos koos meeletu töörügamisega paneb Lenna ja Lauri suhte tõsiselt proovile. Lenna väsib ehitamisest ja võitleb väsimusega. Paar kaalub isegi talveks linnakorterisse kolimist. Lauri päevad mööduvad Ilmaveerel, kuid Lenna tahab, et ka kodus saaks valmis laste mängumaja ja uus kanakuut.","videos":[{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:1","title":"Osa 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:2","title":"Osa 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:3","title":"Osa 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:4","title":"Osa 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:5","title":"Osa 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:6","title":"Osa 6","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:7","title":"Osa 7","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg","overview":"Setomaal peetakse Kostipäeva ja Ilmaveere uksed on esimest korda külalistele lahti. Ehitus on läinud planeeritust oluliselt kallimaks. Palju kogu maja maksma läheb ja kas raha jätkub? Esimese ürituseni on jäänud ainult kaks ja pool kuud, aga kuskilt ei paista, et keskus võiks selle ajaga valmis saada. Mida pere ette võtab?"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:8","title":"Osa 8","season":1,"episode":8,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg","overview":"Lennal ja Lauril on ainult kaks ja pool kuud aega Ilmaveere keskuse esimene korrus valmis saada. Aga raha on otsas! Pere otsustab teha siseviimistlust nii palju kui võimalik ise. Sügis saabub aga varakult ja viimased välitööd jäävad jälle toppama. Lenna ja Lauri otsustavad ehitamise, restoranipidamise ja keskuse töö korraldamise kõrvalt hakata veel farmeriteks."},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:9","title":"Osa 9","season":1,"episode":9,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:10","title":"Osa 10","season":1,"episode":10,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"},{"id":"duoplay:10048:ep:11","title":"Osa 11","season":1,"episode":11,"thumbnail":"https://f12.pmo.ee/4H91CONum_qsptlNG3EjhptOlp0=/1440x645/smart/filters:format(webp)/duo/telecasts/23-100-2095/1726649227-3f44e92a-64bd-45da-a9dc-1113fa0e3a96.jpeg"}]}}